  "resposta": "I could not find specific payment information for Mercado Bom Preço regarding producer Josefa Alves de Souza (P008) in September. However, the documents show that Josefa Alves de Souza's organic certification (ORG-PE-2024-003876) expired on September 30, 2026 [fonte: certificacoes/cert_organica_josefa_souza_P008.txt]. She requested renewal on September 15, 2026, with an audit scheduled for November 15, 2026, meaning her products cannot be commercialized as organic until the renewal is complete [fonte: certificacoes/cert_organica_josefa_souza_P008.txt]. Furthermore, the contract with Mercado Bom Preço (Nº 012/2026) specifies general payment terms as bank slips due 30 days after delivery deposited in the cooperative's bank account [fonte: contratos/contrato_mercado_bom_preco.txt].",
